  "job_B14.20_20251003_114305": {
    "text": "\u00c6\u00feelredes cyninges ger\u00e6dnisse.\n\u00d0is is seo ger\u00e6dnys, \u00f0e \u00e6\u00feelred cyning & his witan ger\u00e6ddon, eallon folce to fri\u00fees bote, \u00e6t\n\u00de\u00e6t is, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6lc freoman getreowne borh h\u00e6bbe, \u00fe\u00e6t se borh hine to \u00e6lcon rihte gehealde, gif he\nGyf he \u00f0onne tyhtbysig sy, gange to \u00feam \u00feryfealdan ordale.\nGif se hlaford s\u00e6cge, \u00fe\u00e6t him na\u00f0er ne burste ne a\u00f0 ne ordal, sy\u00f0\u00f0an \u00fe\u00e6t gemot w\u00e6s \u00e6t Bromdune,\nGif se a\u00f0 \u00feonne for\u00f0cume, ceose se man \u00feonne, \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6r betyhtlet sy, swa hwe\u00f0er he wylle swa anfeald\nGif hy \u00feonne a\u00fe syllan ne durron, gange to \u00feam \u00feryfealdan ordale.\nGif he \u00feonne ful wur\u00f0e, \u00e6t \u00feam forman cyrre bete \u00feam teonde twygylde & \u00feam hlaforde his were &\n& \u00e6t \u00feam o\u00feran cyrre ne sy \u00fe\u00e6r nan o\u00f0er bot butan \u00fe\u00e6t hlaford.\nGif he \u00feonne uthleape & \u00fe\u00e6t ordal forbuge, gylde se borh \u00feam teonde his ceapgyld & \u00feam hlaforde his\n& gyf mon \u00feone hlaford teo, \u00fe\u00e6t he be his r\u00e6de utthleope & \u00e6r unriht worhte, nime him fif \u00feegnas to\n& gif seo lad for\u00f0cume, beo he \u00fe\u00e6s weres wur\u00f0e.\n& gif heo for\u00f0 ne cume, fo se cyning to \u00feam were, & beo se \u00feeof utlah wi\u00f0 eall folc.\n& h\u00e6bbe \u00e6lc hlaford his hiredmen on his agenon borge.\nGif he \u00f0onne betyhtled wur\u00f0e he utt o\u00fehleape, gylde se hlaford \u00fe\u00e6s mannes were \u00feam cyninge.\n& gif man \u00feone hlaford teo, \u00fe\u00e6t he be his r\u00e6de uthleope, ladie hine mid fif \u00feegnum & beo him sylf\nGif him seo lad byrste, gylde \u00feam cynge his were, & sy se man utlah.\n& beo se cyng \u00e6lc \u00fe\u00e6ra wita wyr\u00f0e, \u00fee \u00fea men gewyrcen \u00fee bocland habban; & ne bete nan man for\n& gif \u00feeowman ful wur\u00f0e \u00e6t \u00feam ordale, mearcie man hine \u00e6t \u00f0am forman cyrre.\n& \u00e6t \u00f0am o\u00f0rum cyrre ne sy \u00fe\u00e6r nan o\u00feer bot buton \u00fe\u00e6t heafod.\n& \u00fe\u00e6t nan man ne do na\u00feor: ne ne bycge ne ne hwirfe, buton he borh h\u00e6bbe & gewitnesse.\nGif hit \u00feonne hwa do, fo se landhlaford to & healde \u00fe\u00e6t orf, o\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t man wite, hwa hit age mid rihte.\n& gif hwylc man sy, \u00fee eallon folce ungetrywe sy, fare \u00fe\u00e6s cynges gerefa to & gebringe hine under\nGif he \u00f0onne borh n\u00e6bbe, slea mon hine & on ful lecge.\n& gif hwa hine forenne forstande, beon hy begen anes rihtes wyr\u00f0e.\n& se \u00fee \u00feys forsytte & hit gefor\u00f0ian nylle, swa ure ealra cwide is, sylle \u00feam cynge CXX scillinga.",
